{"id":"sarnafil-g-410-15lfelt","rules":[{"id":"sarnafil-g-410-15lfelt:product_relation:2c5e6143","type":"product_relation","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["waterproofing_membrane"]},"mentions":["sarnafil-g-410-15l"],"text":"It contains ultraviolet light stabilisers according to EN 13956 / GB 12952. Sarnafil® G 410-15 L Felt is a hot-air weldable roof membrane, formulated for direct exposure and designed for use in all global climatic conditions.","heading":"DESCRIPTION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/8/sarnafil_g_410-15lfelt.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 01.02","section":"DESCRIPTION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/roofing/pvc-sheet-membranes/membranes/sarnafil-g-410-15lfelt.html"}},{"id":"sarnafil-g-410-15lfelt:product_relation:0798a66e","type":"product_relation","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["waterproofing_membrane"]},"mentions":["sarnafil-g-410-15l"],"text":"The use of Sarnafil® G 410-15 L Felt membrane is limited to geographical locations with average monthly minimum temperatures of - 50 °C. Permanent ambient temperature during use is limited to + 50°C.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/8/sarnafil_g_410-15lfelt.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 01.02","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/roofing/pvc-sheet-membranes/membranes/sarnafil-g-410-15lfelt.html"}},{"id":"sarnafil-g-410-15lfelt:compatibility:5dc79b8b","type":"compatibility","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":["sarnafil-g-410-15l"],"text":"Sarnafil® G 410-15 L sheet for detailing","heading":"System information > System structure","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/8/sarnafil_g_410-15lfelt.pdf","page":2,"page_end":2,"doc_version":"April 2023, Ver